L["Intro Text"] = "Some stories start with a letter. Others with a rumor, a missing traveler, or a name somebody says a little too quietly at the edge of town.\n\nStory Mode gathers them and lays them out chapter by chapter: who's asking, where to begin, and what's still waiting for you.\n\nFinish a chapter and it goes in your journal, told the way you'll remember it. Mostly true.\n\nPick a story. Somebody out there is already asking for you."
L["Intro Text Complete"] = "Every story here is finished. Letters answered, rumors run down, lost names found, and more than one locked door that isn't locked anymore.\n\nThat's no small thing. You followed every clue and saw every chapter through, and your journal has the tales to prove it. Most of them are even true.\n\nPull up a chair. You've earned the telling."

