L["Welcome Letter Greeting"] = "Dear adventurer,"
L["Welcome Letter"] = "I made Story Mode for everyone who loves Warcraft's lore and wants to live it. It finds the great quest chains and leads you through them one chapter at a time, so you can take it slow and stop to smell the Peacebloom.\n\nPick a story on the left to begin. Every chapter you finish goes in your journal, written the way you'd tell it at the inn. Mostly true.\n\nThe quest cards don't have to tell you everything, though. Be guided and you'll see every quest ahead of time, or explore and find each one when you get there. That choice is on the next page."
L["Welcome Letter Closing"] = "Safe travels,"
