L["Deep in the mountains of Highmountain lay a shield forged from a scale of Neltharion, the Earth-Warder, before madness claimed him and he became Deathwing. You braved the ancient caverns and faced the guardians left behind to protect it. The Scale of the Earth-Warder was heavier than any shield you had ever held, but it was unyielding, and so were you."] = "Deep in the mountains of Highmountain lay a shield forged from a scale of Neltharion, the Earth-Warder, before madness claimed him and he became Deathwing. You braved the ancient caverns and faced the guardians left behind to protect it. The Scale of the Earth-Warder was heavier than any shield you had ever held, but it was unyielding, and so were you."
