L["Deep in the tunnels beneath Suramar, you found Arcanist Kel'danath on the edge of withering, his brilliant mind nearly consumed by mana starvation. You fought through packs of feral withered to reach him, recovering his scattered research notes and the remnants of his arcane experiments. His knowledge of ancient Nightborne magic proved invaluable to the growing rebellion."] = "Deep in the tunnels beneath Suramar, you found Arcanist Kel'danath on the edge of withering, his brilliant mind nearly consumed by mana starvation. You fought through packs of feral withered to reach him, recovering his scattered research notes and the remnants of his arcane experiments. His knowledge of ancient Nightborne magic proved invaluable to the growing rebellion."
