L["Duke Lankral appeared in Dalaran with an urgent summons: the Knights of the Ebon Blade needed you at Acherus. The Ebon Hold floated above the Broken Isles like a fortress of iron and frost, and Highlord Darion Mograine spoke of a pact of necessity: the living would fight the Legion their way, and the dead would fight it theirs. You claimed an artifact weapon forged for death itself."] = "Duke Lankral appeared in Dalaran with an urgent summons: the Knights of the Ebon Blade needed you at Acherus. The Ebon Hold floated above the Broken Isles like a fortress of iron and frost, and Highlord Darion Mograine spoke of a pact of necessity: the living would fight the Legion their way, and the dead would fight it theirs. You claimed an artifact weapon forged for death itself."
