L["Duke Lankral told of the Maw of the Damned, a vampiric greataxe that drank the blood of its enemies and fed it to its wielder. The weapon had been lost in a Legion stronghold, guarded by demons who had learned to fear it. You stormed their fortress and tore the Maw from the hands of its demonic captor. The axe drank deep on the way out."] = "Duke Lankral told of the Maw of the Damned, a vampiric greataxe that drank the blood of its enemies and fed it to its wielder. The weapon had been lost in a Legion stronghold, guarded by demons who had learned to fear it. You stormed their fortress and tore the Maw from the hands of its demonic captor. The axe drank deep on the way out."
