L["For those who once swore loyalty to the Banshee Queen, a final message arrives: not to excuse the past, but to acknowledge it. The Forsaken move forward, but the echoes of old vows still linger in the ruins of Lordaeron."] = "For those who once swore loyalty to the Banshee Queen, a final message arrives: not to excuse the past, but to acknowledge it. The Forsaken move forward, but the echoes of old vows still linger in the ruins of Lordaeron."
