L["From Acherus: The Ebon Hold, the Knights of the Ebon Blade wage their own war against the Burning Legion. The order has no king. It has a Deathlord, and the Deathlord is you.\n\nRaise champions from graveyards across history, gather an army that does not fear death, and decide how far the Ebon Blade is willing to go when the living world needs monsters on its side."] = "From Acherus: The Ebon Hold, the Knights of the Ebon Blade wage their own war against the Burning Legion. The order has no king. It has a Deathlord, and the Deathlord is you.\n\nRaise champions from graveyards across history, gather an army that does not fear death, and decide how far the Ebon Blade is willing to go when the living world needs monsters on its side."
L["From Dreadscar Rift, a pocket of the Twisting Nether claimed by force, the Council of the Black Harvest commands demons to fight demons. It is dangerous work, which is exactly why warlocks are suited to it.\n\nAs Netherlord, rebuild the council, bargain with powers that should not be trusted, and prove that a stolen weapon can still be aimed."] = "From Dreadscar Rift, a pocket of the Twisting Nether claimed by force, the Council of the Black Harvest commands demons to fight demons. It is dangerous work, which is exactly why warlocks are suited to it.\n\nAs Netherlord, rebuild the council, bargain with powers that should not be trusted, and prove that a stolen weapon can still be aimed."
L["From the Depths of Azjol-Nerub"] = "From the Depths of Azjol-Nerub"
L["From the Fel Hammer on Mardum, the Illidari wage war against the Burning Legion with the very weapons of the enemy. Their methods are feared, their purpose is absolute, and their enemies know them well.\n\nAs the chosen Slayer, unite the demon hunters, reclaim old ground, and carry the fight into places where fel fire has ruled for ages."] = "From the Fel Hammer on Mardum, the Illidari wage war against the Burning Legion with the very weapons of the enemy. Their methods are feared, their purpose is absolute, and their enemies know them well.\n\nAs the chosen Slayer, unite the demon hunters, reclaim old ground, and carry the fight into places where fel fire has ruled for ages."
L["From Trueshot Lodge high in the mountains, the Unseen Path watches over Azeroth. Its hunters know the old trails, the hidden passes, and the signs most armies march past without seeing.\n\nAs the order's newest champion, recruit legendary trackers, root out Legion threats, and defend the wild places and cities that still need sharp eyes on the horizon."] = "From Trueshot Lodge high in the mountains, the Unseen Path watches over Azeroth. Its hunters know the old trails, the hidden passes, and the signs most armies march past without seeing.\n\nAs the order's newest champion, recruit legendary trackers, root out Legion threats, and defend the wild places and cities that still need sharp eyes on the horizon."
