L["Greatmother Icemist weeps over a quiet fire. Her son is chained somewhere beneath this frozen plain, and her daughter Banthok is ready to cut every Anub'ar web in the world to bring him home. The Taunka are a proud and wounded people, shaggy cousins to the Tauren whose strength the Scourge has long bled for sport. If they rise again, they rise with the Horde."] = "Greatmother Icemist weeps over a quiet fire. Her son is chained somewhere beneath this frozen plain, and her daughter Banthok is ready to cut every Anub'ar web in the world to bring him home. The Taunka are a proud and wounded people, shaggy cousins to the Tauren whose strength the Scourge has long bled for sport. If they rise again, they rise with the Horde."
