L["Grif Wildheart spoke of Titanstrike, a rifle of immense power forged by Mimiron himself in the halls of Ulduar. You embarked on a beastly expedition to recover the weapon, facing titan constructs and wild guardians. When you finally held Titanstrike, its mechanisms hummed with the power of a thousand storms."] = "Grif Wildheart spoke of Titanstrike, a rifle of immense power forged by Mimiron himself in the halls of Ulduar. You embarked on a beastly expedition to recover the weapon, facing titan constructs and wild guardians. When you finally held Titanstrike, its mechanisms hummed with the power of a thousand storms."
