L["Kor'vas Bloodthorn found you in Dalaran with an urgent message: the Illidari needed a leader. You answered the call and claimed a weapon forged from the demons' own power. On Mardum, the Fel Hammer became your stronghold, a Legion command ship turned against its former masters. With Kayn Sunfury at your side, you gazed through the Hunter's Gaze across the Broken Isles and directed the Illidari's wrath."] = "Kor'vas Bloodthorn found you in Dalaran with an urgent message: the Illidari needed a leader. You answered the call and claimed a weapon forged from the demons' own power. On Mardum, the Fel Hammer became your stronghold, a Legion command ship turned against its former masters. With Kayn Sunfury at your side, you gazed through the Hunter's Gaze across the Broken Isles and directed the Illidari's wrath."
