L["Lea Stonepaw told of the Claws of Ursoc, weapons that carried the strength of the bear god who had given his life defending Azeroth. You entered the nightmare-touched dens where the Claws had been hidden and fought through the corruption to reclaim them. The weight of Ursoc's sacrifice settled into your hands along with the weapons: a guardian's burden, willingly carried."] = "Lea Stonepaw told of the Claws of Ursoc, weapons that carried the strength of the bear god who had given his life defending Azeroth. You entered the nightmare-touched dens where the Claws had been hidden and fought through the corruption to reclaim them. The weight of Ursoc's sacrifice settled into your hands along with the weapons: a guardian's burden, willingly carried."
