L["Scouting reports painted a grim picture: Legion assassins had infiltrated the Broken Isles, targeting the Unseen Path's agents. You tracked them through Stormheim, rescuing Hudson Crawford from an ambush and calling Beastmaster Hilaire home from the wilds. In Highmountain, you found Rexxar living among the beasts and convinced the legendary hunter to join your cause. With new champions at your side, the Unseen Path's eyes grew sharper."] = "Scouting reports painted a grim picture: Legion assassins had infiltrated the Broken Isles, targeting the Unseen Path's agents. You tracked them through Stormheim, rescuing Hudson Crawford from an ambush and calling Beastmaster Hilaire home from the wilds. In Highmountain, you found Rexxar living among the beasts and convinced the legendary hunter to join your cause. With new champions at your side, the Unseen Path's eyes grew sharper."
