L["The campaign pushes into the ruins of Gilneas. A traitor needs to be dealt with, and the Gilneas Liberation Front is running out of room to maneuver."] = "The campaign pushes into the ruins of Gilneas. A traitor needs to be dealt with, and the Gilneas Liberation Front is running out of room to maneuver."
