L["The draenei's strength comes from memory, faith, and resilience. By sharing burdens old and new, you helped your people move forward without forgetting what they endured."] = "The draenei's strength comes from memory, faith, and resilience. By sharing burdens old and new, you helped your people move forward without forgetting what they endured."
