L["The saronite mines beneath Ymirheim are not just a supply line. They are something older, colder, and hungrier than any ore vein on Azeroth. The metal whispers. Miners chained to the walls hear their names called by voices they once loved. The Argent Crusade has quiet questions about what prolonged exposure does to a living mind. The answers do not make it out of the tunnels."] = "The saronite mines beneath Ymirheim are not just a supply line. They are something older, colder, and hungrier than any ore vein on Azeroth. The metal whispers. Miners chained to the walls hear their names called by voices they once loved. The Argent Crusade has quiet questions about what prolonged exposure does to a living mind. The answers do not make it out of the tunnels."
