L["The Waning Crescent"] = "The Waning Crescent"
L["The war at sea gave the Horde what blades on land could not: Derek Proudmoore, heir to Kul Tiras, dead at the bottom of the ocean. Hobart Grapplehammer put you in a diving suit and you went down. The ocean floor was littered with the wreckage of the battle: dog tags, sunken ships, the bones of sailors on both sides. You found Derek and hauled him up. No one said what Sylvanas would do with him. No one had to."] = "The war at sea gave the Horde what blades on land could not: Derek Proudmoore, heir to Kul Tiras, dead at the bottom of the ocean. Hobart Grapplehammer put you in a diving suit and you went down. The ocean floor was littered with the wreckage of the battle: dog tags, sunken ships, the bones of sailors on both sides. You found Derek and hauled him up. No one said what Sylvanas would do with him. No one had to."
L["The war ended. Sylvanas was gone. And Lilian Voss led the Forsaken home.\n\nThey came back to ruins: streets flooded with Blight, Undercity dark and broken. Calia Menethil walked beside her, daughter of the last king of Lordaeron, and between the two of them they held the Forsaken together through all of it: the plague work, the dead to bury, the city to reclaim room by room. At the end they formed the Desolate Council: Lilian, Calia, Velonara, Belmont, Faranell. Not a Dark Lady, not a warchief. A council. Their own.\n\nLilian Voss, who had spent her whole life as something to be used and discarded, had become the person her people followed home."] = "The war ended. Sylvanas was gone. And Lilian Voss led the Forsaken home.\n\nThey came back to ruins: streets flooded with Blight, Undercity dark and broken. Calia Menethil walked beside her, daughter of the last king of Lordaeron, and between the two of them they held the Forsaken together through all of it: the plague work, the dead to bury, the city to reclaim room by room. At the end they formed the Desolate Council: Lilian, Calia, Velonara, Belmont, Faranell. Not a Dark Lady, not a warchief. A council. Their own.\n\nLilian Voss, who had spent her whole life as something to be used and discarded, had become the person her people followed home."
L["The War for Silverpine"] = "The War for Silverpine"
L["The war in the Shadowlands is over. Sylvanas stands before those she has wronged, and must face what comes next."] = "The war in the Shadowlands is over. Sylvanas stands before those she has wronged, and must face what comes next."
L["The war moves to the Broken Shore. Aethas Sunreaver leads the Tirisgarde's assault, and you earn the Archmage's Prismatic Disc."] = "The war moves to the Broken Shore. Aethas Sunreaver leads the Tirisgarde's assault, and you earn the Archmage's Prismatic Disc."
L["The war moves to the Broken Shore. Contend with Magatha Grimtotem, secure Smolderon's flame, and earn a mount of living storm."] = "The war moves to the Broken Shore. Contend with Magatha Grimtotem, secure Smolderon's flame, and earn a mount of living storm."
L["The war moves to the Broken Shore. Lead the Unseen Path against the Legion's corrupted beasts and earn the trust of a loyal wolfhawk."] = "The war moves to the Broken Shore. Lead the Unseen Path against the Legion's corrupted beasts and earn the trust of a loyal wolfhawk."
L["The war moves to the Broken Shore. Rally the Valarjar for a final push, brave the depths of Helheim, and earn your war wyrm."] = "The war moves to the Broken Shore. Rally the Valarjar for a final push, brave the depths of Helheim, and earn your war wyrm."
