L["The war reaches the Broken Shore. Defend the wilds, recruit Thisalee Crow, and earn the Archdruid's Lunarwing flight form."] = "The war reaches the Broken Shore. Defend the wilds, recruit Thisalee Crow, and earn the Archdruid's Lunarwing flight form."
