L["The Warswords of the Valarjar called to you: twin blades said to contain the fury of a hundred battles. Odyn sent you to Stormheim to hunt the hero-slayer who had stolen them. Through storm and fire, you tracked the thief to their lair and pried the swords from their grip. The runes along the blades blazed to life in your hands, as if they had been waiting."] = "The Warswords of the Valarjar called to you: twin blades said to contain the fury of a hundred battles. Odyn sent you to Stormheim to hunt the hero-slayer who had stolen them. Through storm and fire, you tracked the thief to their lair and pried the swords from their grip. The runes along the blades blazed to life in your hands, as if they had been waiting."
