L["Walk the long road that turned Prince Arthas Menethil into the Lich King, and the longer road taken by those who march north to face him. It begins in Stratholme, where a prince makes an unforgivable choice in the name of salvation.\n\nBetween that memory and Icecrown lie the dragon-haunted plains of Dragonblight, the howling reach of Northrend, and a campaign waged in the long shadow of Frostmourne."] = "Walk the long road that turned Prince Arthas Menethil into the Lich King, and the longer road taken by those who march north to face him. It begins in Stratholme, where a prince makes an unforgivable choice in the name of salvation.\n\nBetween that memory and Icecrown lie the dragon-haunted plains of Dragonblight, the howling reach of Northrend, and a campaign waged in the long shadow of Frostmourne."
L["Walk the saronite tunnels below Ymirheim and test what the whispers can do to a soldier's mind."] = "Walk the saronite tunnels below Ymirheim and test what the whispers can do to a soldier's mind."
L["Walk with Lor'themar through the memory of Quel'Thalas and what the Sin'dorei lost when Arthas marched on Silvermoon. The grief is older than many kingdoms, and the silence the Scourge left behind still has weight.\n\nStand where names are remembered, face old wounds with care, and honor the heritage of a people whose line endured even when the kingdom nearly did not."] = "Walk with Lor'themar through the memory of Quel'Thalas and what the Sin'dorei lost when Arthas marched on Silvermoon. The grief is older than many kingdoms, and the silence the Scourge left behind still has weight.\n\nStand where names are remembered, face old wounds with care, and honor the heritage of a people whose line endured even when the kingdom nearly did not."
