L["North of the road into Deadwind Pass, two Forsaken agents keep a quiet post at Beggar's Haunt. A human infiltrator has seen too much, and Stonard's orcs have taken him alive before the matter could be settled.\n\nWork with Deathstalker Zraedus and Apothecary Faustin on a serum meant to draw out the truth."] = "North of the road into Deadwind Pass, two Forsaken agents keep a quiet post at Beggar's Haunt. A human infiltrator has seen too much, and Stonard's orcs have taken him alive before the matter could be settled.\n\nWork with Deathstalker Zraedus and Apothecary Faustin on a serum meant to draw out the truth."
