L["At Steamwheedle Port, Yeh'kinya asks for help with old troll spirits and older tablets. It sounds like simple archaeology, and Yeh'kinya is very polite about it.\n\nFollow the tablets from Feralas and Zul'Farrak into older and darker places, and see where an old troll's errand leads."] = "At Steamwheedle Port, Yeh'kinya asks for help with old troll spirits and older tablets. It sounds like simple archaeology, and Yeh'kinya is very polite about it.\n\nFollow the tablets from Feralas and Zul'Farrak into older and darker places, and see where an old troll's errand leads."
L["Tanaris / Feralas / Zul'Farrak / The Hinterlands / Sunken Temple / Blackrock Spire / Stranglethorn Vale"] = "Tanaris / Feralas / Zul'Farrak / The Hinterlands / Sunken Temple / Blackrock Spire / Stranglethorn Vale"
