L["The crystal caverns beneath Desolace are holy ground, burial ground, and wound all at once. Satyrs, centaur spirits and corrupted plants all pull at the same buried story.\n\nEnter Maraudon from the orange and purple passages and follow its old stories as far down as they go."] = "The crystal caverns beneath Desolace are holy ground, burial ground, and wound all at once. Satyrs, centaur spirits and corrupted plants all pull at the same buried story.\n\nEnter Maraudon from the orange and purple passages and follow its old stories as far down as they go."
