L["Caer Darrow's ruined school is locked behind more than a door. The Scourge has made Scholomance a place of experiments, ghosts and old family secrets that refuse to stay buried.\n\nForge the Skeleton Key, then follow the stories Caer Darrow's ghosts still want told."] = "Caer Darrow's ruined school is locked behind more than a door. The Scourge has made Scholomance a place of experiments, ghosts and old family secrets that refuse to stay buried.\n\nForge the Skeleton Key, then follow the stories Caer Darrow's ghosts still want told."
L["Western Plaguelands / Tanaris / Un'Goro Crater / Scholomance"] = "Western Plaguelands / Tanaris / Un'Goro Crater / Scholomance"
