L["In the Badlands, a red dragon hides behind a simple name and a very dangerous plan. Rhea wants to save the future of the black dragonflight from Deathwing's madness, and she needs samples, secrecy, and one gnome scientist who is just strange enough to help.\n\nFollow Rhea's work from Lethlor Ravine to the Hidden Clutch, then stay for the Badlands locals arguing over what really happened when Deathwing came."] = "In the Badlands, a red dragon hides behind a simple name and a very dangerous plan. Rhea wants to save the future of the black dragonflight from Deathwing's madness, and she needs samples, secrecy, and one gnome scientist who is just strange enough to help.\n\nFollow Rhea's work from Lethlor Ravine to the Hidden Clutch, then stay for the Badlands locals arguing over what really happened when Deathwing came."
