L["Rhea's defense force was improvised in true Badlands fashion. Alliance adventurers recruited Eric, Baelog, and Olaf. Horde adventurers recruited Amakkar, Jurrix, and Gargal. The work was strange, dangerous, and somehow hopeful.\n\nThen Deathwing came. The clutch was exposed, Rhea's plan became a sacrifice, and the last egg had to survive without the dragon who had made it possible."] = "Rhea's defense force was improvised in true Badlands fashion. Alliance adventurers recruited Eric, Baelog, and Olaf. Horde adventurers recruited Amakkar, Jurrix, and Gargal. The work was strange, dangerous, and somehow hopeful.\n\nThen Deathwing came. The clutch was exposed, Rhea's plan became a sacrifice, and the last egg had to survive without the dragon who had made it possible."
