L["Dr. Blam reveals Rhea's final deception and the secret she preserved: one uncorrupted black dragon egg."] = "Dr. Blam reveals Rhea's final deception and the secret she preserved: one uncorrupted black dragon egg."
L["Deathwing believed he had destroyed Rhea's work. Dr. Blam revealed the truth: Rhea had hidden the real egg and left a false trail behind. Her last act was not only sacrifice, but misdirection.\n\nThe egg lived. Somewhere beyond Deathwing's reach, the future black dragon Wrathion had a chance to exist."] = "Deathwing believed he had destroyed Rhea's work. Dr. Blam revealed the truth: Rhea had hidden the real egg and left a false trail behind. Her last act was not only sacrifice, but misdirection.\n\nThe egg lived. Somewhere beyond Deathwing's reach, the future black dragon Wrathion had a chance to exist."
