L["Kirygosa's life in the Jade Forest was not a problem to solve. It was a life she had made. Kalecgos helped with carp, deliveries, and simple comforts because asking someone to come home means respecting the home they already have.\n\nThe visit became a gentle reminder that the blue dragonflight could be wider than one place. Returning did not have to mean abandoning what had healed them."] = "Kirygosa's life in the Jade Forest was not a problem to solve. It was a life she had made. Kalecgos helped with carp, deliveries, and simple comforts because asking someone to come home means respecting the home they already have.\n\nThe visit became a gentle reminder that the blue dragonflight could be wider than one place. Returning did not have to mean abandoning what had healed them."
