L["Jaina Proudmoore's marines have brought in a man found washed up on the shore, and his claim is one SI:7 cannot ignore. Master Mathias Shaw wants someone discreet in Theramore to learn the truth. In Orgrimmar, Eitrigg has a worry of his own: a band of Kor'kron Elite sent into Dustwallow Marsh is long overdue.\n\nBoth trails bend toward Alcaz Island, an old ruin off the marsh's coast that hardly anyone thinks about. Whatever waits beneath its keep, someone has gone to great lengths to hide it."] = "Jaina Proudmoore's marines have brought in a man found washed up on the shore, and his claim is one SI:7 cannot ignore. Master Mathias Shaw wants someone discreet in Theramore to learn the truth. In Orgrimmar, Eitrigg has a worry of his own: a band of Kor'kron Elite sent into Dustwallow Marsh is long overdue.\n\nBoth trails bend toward Alcaz Island, an old ruin off the marsh's coast that hardly anyone thinks about. Whatever waits beneath its keep, someone has gone to great lengths to hide it."
