L["Azshara's broken towers still hold the secrets of the highborne, and everyone has come to dig for them. Night elf sentinels at Talrendis Point fight the Spitelash naga for the ruins of Eldarath, while at Valormok the Horde has paid in blood for trusting a blood elf mage.\n\nTo the north, the Blackmaw furbolgs shelter in the camps of Ursolan, driven from their home by the Legashi satyr and sickening from the corruption the demons spread. Their gatekeeper is looking for allies."] = "Azshara's broken towers still hold the secrets of the highborne, and everyone has come to dig for them. Night elf sentinels at Talrendis Point fight the Spitelash naga for the ruins of Eldarath, while at Valormok the Horde has paid in blood for trusting a blood elf mage.\n\nTo the north, the Blackmaw furbolgs shelter in the camps of Ursolan, driven from their home by the Legashi satyr and sickening from the corruption the demons spread. Their gatekeeper is looking for allies."
