L["No one has held the Riverglades for long. The humans of Farholde Keep, who feel Stormwind has forgotten them, and the orcs of Rog'mar have fought each other across the river for years. Now the Twilight's Hammer has burned the village of Sunnyglade and started digging under the hills.\n\nFarholde and Rog'mar both need to know what the cult is looking for. For the Horde, the answer may lie with ogres who have already turned their backs on it."] = "No one has held the Riverglades for long. The humans of Farholde Keep, who feel Stormwind has forgotten them, and the orcs of Rog'mar have fought each other across the river for years. Now the Twilight's Hammer has burned the village of Sunnyglade and started digging under the hills.\n\nFarholde and Rog'mar both need to know what the cult is looking for. For the Horde, the answer may lie with ogres who have already turned their backs on it."
