L["The old feud between the Magram and the Gelkis has spilled into Shen'dralas, where elven ruins hide a valley of bones and a dark magic that answers to whoever reaches for it. Whichever clan you call friend, the dead there will not stay quiet.\n\nBeyond the centaur battle lines, cracked pylons hum in the forest, a reclusive order of elves still keeps its temple, and a gardener wonders what became of the treants she left to guard her flowers."] = "The old feud between the Magram and the Gelkis has spilled into Shen'dralas, where elven ruins hide a valley of bones and a dark magic that answers to whoever reaches for it. Whichever clan you call friend, the dead there will not stay quiet.\n\nBeyond the centaur battle lines, cracked pylons hum in the forest, a reclusive order of elves still keeps its temple, and a gardener wonders what became of the treants she left to guard her flowers."
