L["Zephras Isle floats in Skywall, the realm of Al'Akir, held aloft by anchor pylons the wind spirits left behind. The spirits are gone, the pylons falter, and the Al'Aketh cult preaches that only devotion to the Windlord can save the Skyborne.\n\nCome of age in Thendal Grove, then carry the island's troubles from Shen'dar Village to the port of Valanaar, where the High Order and the Windshapers distrust each other almost as much as they fear High Priestess Lorthuna."] = "Zephras Isle floats in Skywall, the realm of Al'Akir, held aloft by anchor pylons the wind spirits left behind. The spirits are gone, the pylons falter, and the Al'Aketh cult preaches that only devotion to the Windlord can save the Skyborne.\n\nCome of age in Thendal Grove, then carry the island's troubles from Shen'dar Village to the port of Valanaar, where the High Order and the Windshapers distrust each other almost as much as they fear High Priestess Lorthuna."
