L["Myrokos Silentform has work for Ravenholdt's agents. The Syndicate has grown bold in the hills of Alterac and Arathi, and someone must cut it where it will bleed the most."] = "Myrokos Silentform has work for Ravenholdt's agents. The Syndicate has grown bold in the hills of Alterac and Arathi, and someone must cut it where it will bleed the most."
L["You began by removing Lord Tomas from Durnholde Keep. Later, Myrokos had you lift a scouting report from a Syndicate pocket and beat its searchers to the heirlooms of House Perenolde in the ruins of Alterac. In a stolen uniform you walked into Stromgarde Keep, found the leverage to make Anastasia talk, and broke up the secret handoff at Thoradin's Wall, carrying the prize back to Ravenholdt."] = "You began by removing Lord Tomas from Durnholde Keep. Later, Myrokos had you lift a scouting report from a Syndicate pocket and beat its searchers to the heirlooms of House Perenolde in the ruins of Alterac. In a stolen uniform you walked into Stromgarde Keep, found the leverage to make Anastasia talk, and broke up the secret handoff at Thoradin's Wall, carrying the prize back to Ravenholdt."
