L["Alba was waiting in the hills behind Moonbrook, wearing the look people get right before something loud. I pressed the button. Somewhere under Westfall a forge stopped being a forge, and for the first time in years the soil had a chance. Best thing I ever did with a button."] = "Alba was waiting in the hills behind Moonbrook, wearing the look people get right before something loud. I pressed the button. Somewhere under Westfall a forge stopped being a forge, and for the first time in years the soil had a chance. Best thing I ever did with a button."
