L["The Green Hills of Stranglethorn"] = "The Green Hills of Stranglethorn"
L["In the north of Stranglethorn Vale, a famous dwarf hunter has pitched camp with a handful of companions and a great many guns. Hemet Nesingwary has come for big game, and he only takes on hunters who can prove themselves.\n\nLearn the jungle's tigers, panthers and raptors from the expedition's own hunters, and you may hear what Hemet really came for. Barnil Stonepot, meanwhile, has a small literary emergency and would rather Master Nesingwary never heard about it."] = "In the north of Stranglethorn Vale, a famous dwarf hunter has pitched camp with a handful of companions and a great many guns. Hemet Nesingwary has come for big game, and he only takes on hunters who can prove themselves.\n\nLearn the jungle's tigers, panthers and raptors from the expedition's own hunters, and you may hear what Hemet really came for. Barnil Stonepot, meanwhile, has a small literary emergency and would rather Master Nesingwary never heard about it."
