L["James Halloran had heard about the ruins up in the highlands and the raptors living around them. The raptors could hide all they liked, as far as Halloran was concerned, so long as they had hides. I brought back four. They'll make good trim, I'm told, and I got to try on the tanner's stock and pick something in trade."] = "James Halloran had heard about the ruins up in the highlands and the raptors living around them. The raptors could hide all they liked, as far as Halloran was concerned, so long as they had hides. I brought back four. They'll make good trim, I'm told, and I got to try on the tanner's stock and pick something in trade."
