L["Carried Home"] = "Carried Home"
L["Ardin Grassman, at the far end of the dig, has something for you to carry home to his wife in Menethil Harbor. In Lakeshire, Dorin Songblade is waiting to hear about his brother."] = "Ardin Grassman, at the far end of the dig, has something for you to carry home to his wife in Menethil Harbor. In Lakeshire, Dorin Songblade is waiting to hear about his brother."
L["Caitlin's husband needed a rest before he could walk out on his own, along the path I'd cleared. While he rested he braided some reeds into a heart and asked me to take it to her, and to tell her he'd be home soon. Caitlin held it close and started planning him a hearty supper.\n\nBefore I left the dig I covered Daewyn with his cloak. Then I went to Lakeshire and told Dorin. He blamed himself for staying behind. He'd been making gear for his brother as a surprise, and finished it after Daewyn had already gone. He couldn't bring himself to sell it or rework it, so he gave it to me."] = "Caitlin's husband needed a rest before he could walk out on his own, along the path I'd cleared. While he rested he braided some reeds into a heart and asked me to take it to her, and to tell her he'd be home soon. Caitlin held it close and started planning him a hearty supper.\n\nBefore I left the dig I covered Daewyn with his cloak. Then I went to Lakeshire and told Dorin. He blamed himself for staying behind. He'd been making gear for his brother as a surprise, and finished it after Daewyn had already gone. He couldn't bring himself to sell it or rework it, so he gave it to me."
