L["Beldin Steelgrill in Kharanos has heard about a campfire on the hills above Gol'Bolar Quarry, high up where it looks down over the whole quarry. It's probably nothing, but Beldin would like someone to go up and see who's sitting by it.\n\nFrom there the trail leads back to Ironforge and down beneath it, past the High Seat to the Hall of Thanes, a part of the city most visitors never see. Take a few friends along for that."] = "Beldin Steelgrill in Kharanos has heard about a campfire on the hills above Gol'Bolar Quarry, high up where it looks down over the whole quarry. It's probably nothing, but Beldin would like someone to go up and see who's sitting by it.\n\nFrom there the trail leads back to Ironforge and down beneath it, past the High Seat to the Hall of Thanes, a part of the city most visitors never see. Take a few friends along for that."
