L["Gerrig Bonegrip, down in the Forlorn Cavern in Ironforge, collects lore. Old lore, the sort that opens doorways and can wake Those Who Sleep. Gerrig had heard the Lorgalis Manuscript was lying at the bottom of Blackfathom Deeps and promised not to forget me for it, not even after the end days. I brought it up. Gerrig was overjoyed and is having copies made for all the brothers and sisters, whoever they are."] = "Gerrig Bonegrip, down in the Forlorn Cavern in Ironforge, collects lore. Old lore, the sort that opens doorways and can wake Those Who Sleep. Gerrig had heard the Lorgalis Manuscript was lying at the bottom of Blackfathom Deeps and promised not to forget me for it, not even after the end days. I brought it up. Gerrig was overjoyed and is having copies made for all the brothers and sisters, whoever they are."
L["Researching the Corruption"] = "Researching the Corruption"
L["Gershala Nightwhisper"] = "Gershala Nightwhisper"
L["Gershala Nightwhisper, in Auberdine, is worried about the blood elves and their demon magic, and wanted to know what the same sort of thing had already done to the naga and the satyrs. Blackfathom Deeps has plenty of both, so I came back with eight corrupted brain stems. Gershala thanked me for my selflessness and got straight to work. I left before the work got interesting."] = "Gershala Nightwhisper, in Auberdine, is worried about the blood elves and their demon magic, and wanted to know what the same sort of thing had already done to the naga and the satyrs. Blackfathom Deeps has plenty of both, so I came back with eight corrupted brain stems. Gershala thanked me for my selflessness and got straight to work. I left before the work got interesting."
