L["the depths of Blackfathom Deeps, Ashenvale"] = "the depths of Blackfathom Deeps, Ashenvale"
L["Past Kelris, at the far end of the Deeps, waited Aku'mai, the servant of the Old Gods. When it died it left a pearl behind, and Dawnwatcher Selgorm in Darnassus called the kill the stuff of real heroes. The pearl went off to be studied at once, for whatever it could tell about the Void."] = "Past Kelris, at the far end of the Deeps, waited Aku'mai, the servant of the Old Gods. When it died it left a pearl behind, and Dawnwatcher Selgorm in Darnassus called the kill the stuff of real heroes. The pearl went off to be studied at once, for whatever it could tell about the Void."
