L["Strange Water Globe"] = "Strange Water Globe"
L["Baron Aquanis, a water elemental in the Deeps, left a strange globe behind when it fell. Foul water sloshed about inside, and nothing I did would so much as scratch it. Je'neu Sancrea had long suspected the Baron of being corrupted, and said the globe would show by what, and how. I came away with the Earthen Ring's warmest regards and something more useful besides."] = "Baron Aquanis, a water elemental in the Deeps, left a strange globe behind when it fell. Foul water sloshed about inside, and nothing I did would so much as scratch it. Je'neu Sancrea had long suspected the Baron of being corrupted, and said the globe would show by what, and how. I came away with the Earthen Ring's warmest regards and something more useful besides."
L["Past Kelris, at the far end of the Deeps, waited Aku'mai, the servant of the Old Gods. It left a pearl behind when it died, and Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff called that a mighty service to all of Kalimdor. The pearl was to be studied at once, for what it might say about the Void, and I was sent off to walk with the Earth Mother."] = "Past Kelris, at the far end of the Deeps, waited Aku'mai, the servant of the Old Gods. It left a pearl behind when it died, and Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff called that a mighty service to all of Kalimdor. The pearl was to be studied at once, for what it might say about the Void, and I was sent off to walk with the Earth Mother."
L["The Mad King"] = "The Mad King"
L["Gnomeregan, the gnomes' city under Dun Morogh, was lost to a trogg invasion and a radiation leak, and its people fled to Tinker Town in Ironforge. The machines they left behind are still running down there.\n\nThe exiles want a cure, and their belongings back. In Orgrimmar, the goblins have heard about a new gnomish rig and want its blueprints. Either errand takes you all the way to the bottom of the city."] = "Gnomeregan, the gnomes' city under Dun Morogh, was lost to a trogg invasion and a radiation leak, and its people fled to Tinker Town in Ironforge. The machines they left behind are still running down there.\n\nThe exiles want a cure, and their belongings back. In Orgrimmar, the goblins have heard about a new gnomish rig and want its blueprints. Either errand takes you all the way to the bottom of the city."
L["Gnomeregan, the gnomes' city under Dun Morogh, was lost to troggs and a radiation leak, and its people now live as exiles in Tinker Town, in Ironforge. Gnoarn, one of them, lost a splendid head of hair in the leak and wants the city back.\n\nStart with Gnoarn, and follow the exiles' requests down into Gnomeregan, where High Tinker Mekkatorque has business of his own."] = "Gnomeregan, the gnomes' city under Dun Morogh, was lost to troggs and a radiation leak, and its people now live as exiles in Tinker Town, in Ironforge. Gnoarn, one of them, lost a splendid head of hair in the leak and wants the city back.\n\nStart with Gnoarn, and follow the exiles' requests down into Gnomeregan, where High Tinker Mekkatorque has business of his own."
L["Two years ago, gnome engineering was mostly good for a punch line. Now the gnomes have built a rig better than any goblin shredder, and Nogg, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, wants the blueprints.\n\nThe blueprints are in Gnomeregan, under the mountains of Dun Morogh, a long way from home. Sovik, beside Nogg, knows a faster way in than walking."] = "Two years ago, gnome engineering was mostly good for a punch line. Now the gnomes have built a rig better than any goblin shredder, and Nogg, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, wants the blueprints.\n\nThe blueprints are in Gnomeregan, under the mountains of Dun Morogh, a long way from home. Sovik, beside Nogg, knows a faster way in than walking."
L["Ironforge / Dun Morogh / Orgrimmar / Stranglethorn Vale / Gnomeregan"] = "Ironforge / Dun Morogh / Orgrimmar / Stranglethorn Vale / Gnomeregan"
L["The Day After"] = "The Day After"
L["Gnoarn"] = "Gnoarn"
L["Tinker Town, Ironforge"] = "Tinker Town, Ironforge"
L["the Cathedral of Light, Stormwind"] = "the Cathedral of Light, Stormwind"
L["Darnassus"] = "Darnassus"
L["Windshear Crag, Stonetalon Mountains"] = "Windshear Crag, Stonetalon Mountains"
L["the Valley of Honor, Orgrimmar"] = "the Valley of Honor, Orgrimmar"
L["Gnoarn, in Tinker Town in Ironforge, lost a magnificent head of hair to the radiation leak in Gnomeregan and blames the troggs for all of it. He thinks the city can still be saved, and Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos is working on how."] = "Gnoarn, in Tinker Town in Ironforge, lost a magnificent head of hair to the radiation leak in Gnomeregan and blames the troggs for all of it. He thinks the city can still be saved, and Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos is working on how."
L["There's a gnome in Tinker Town called Gnoarn, bald as an egg, who will tell you that before the radiation leak in Gnomeregan he had the only gnomefro in all of Azeroth. Then he shakes his fist and curses the troggs.\n\nHe sent me to Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos, who stood right beside him when the bolt hit and remembers the hair coming out in clumps. Ozzie and a partner called Razzle were close to some kind of cure, or else the recipe for a very strong rum, and couldn't say which until they'd tested it.\n\nThe test needed fallout off the irradiated troggs around Gnomeregan, so I filled a leaden phial with the green glow. Ozzie had a captured leper gnome lined up to be cured, and was expecting a full head of hair on the side. I was told to stand back, and I stood well back."] = "There's a gnome in Tinker Town called Gnoarn, bald as an egg, who will tell you that before the radiation leak in Gnomeregan he had the only gnomefro in all of Azeroth. Then he shakes his fist and curses the troggs.\n\nHe sent me to Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos, who stood right beside him when the bolt hit and remembers the hair coming out in clumps. Ozzie and a partner called Razzle were close to some kind of cure, or else the recipe for a very strong rum, and couldn't say which until they'd tested it.\n\nThe test needed fallout off the irradiated troggs around Gnomeregan, so I filled a leaden phial with the green glow. Ozzie had a captured leper gnome lined up to be cured, and was expecting a full head of hair on the side. I was told to stand back, and I stood well back."
L["Gnogaine"] = "Gnogaine"
L["Ozzie Togglevolt"] = "Ozzie Togglevolt"
L["The Transpolyporter"] = "The Transpolyporter"
L["Gnomes have built a rig better than any goblin shredder, and Nogg, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, wants the blueprints out of Gnomeregan. Gnomeregan is a long walk through dwarf country. Sovik, beside Nogg, has a quicker way to send you."] = "Gnomes have built a rig better than any goblin shredder, and Nogg, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, wants the blueprints out of Gnomeregan. Gnomeregan is a long walk through dwarf country. Sovik, beside Nogg, has a quicker way to send you."
L["Nogg was sore about gnomes. Two years ago their engineering was mostly good for a punch line, and now they'd built a rig better than every goblin shredder. Nogg wanted the blueprints, which were locked in a safe deep in Gnomeregan, and only the mekgineer sitting beside it knew the combination.\n\nSovik, next to Nogg, had the travel sorted. Sovik and a partner in Booty Bay had built the Transpolyporter 6000 for the trip.\n\nThe partner was Scooty, who showed the machine off like a new boat and said it had only exploded a dozen or so times. If it went up with me on it, I was promised, it would be quick and painless. Scooty tuned a goblin transponder to my size and weight and mentioned a few side effects, none of them permanent anymore. After that, all I had to do was step on the pad."] = "Nogg was sore about gnomes. Two years ago their engineering was mostly good for a punch line, and now they'd built a rig better than every goblin shredder. Nogg wanted the blueprints, which were locked in a safe deep in Gnomeregan, and only the mekgineer sitting beside it knew the combination.\n\nSovik, next to Nogg, had the travel sorted. Sovik and a partner in Booty Bay had built the Transpolyporter 6000 for the trip.\n\nThe partner was Scooty, who showed the machine off like a new boat and said it had only exploded a dozen or so times. If it went up with me on it, I was promised, it would be quick and painless. Scooty tuned a goblin transponder to my size and weight and mentioned a few side effects, none of them permanent anymore. After that, all I had to do was step on the pad."
L["Rig Wars"] = "Rig Wars"
L["Nogg"] = "Nogg"
L["Chief Engineer Scooty"] = "Chief Engineer Scooty"
L["Sovik"] = "Sovik"
L["Gnomer-gooooone!"] = "Gnomer-gooooone!"
L["Scooty"] = "Scooty"
L["The King of Nothing"] = "The King of Nothing"
L["Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos isn't finished with Gnomeregan's fallout, and the exiles in Tinker Town have a long list of things left behind in the city. High Tinker Mekkatorque, in Tinker Town, has a harder job, at the very bottom of it."] = "Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos isn't finished with Gnomeregan's fallout, and the exiles in Tinker Town have a long list of things left behind in the city. High Tinker Mekkatorque, in Tinker Town, has a harder job, at the very bottom of it."
L["Nogg's blueprints are in a safe at the bottom of Gnomeregan, and the only one with the combination is the mekgineer who sits beside it. Between you and the safe lies a whole city of troggs and machines that never got switched off."] = "Nogg's blueprints are in a safe at the bottom of Gnomeregan, and the only one with the combination is the mekgineer who sits beside it. Between you and the safe lies a whole city of troggs and machines that never got switched off."
L["Ozzie's verdict on my first phial was that there wasn't enough in it and what there was had gone impure. The troggs weren't glowing hard enough. I was to get it straight from the tap, off the slimes and horrors deep in Gnomeregan, and that stuff falls apart if you look at it wrong. It took more than one try to bottle. Ozzie looked me over afterwards, impressed that I still had all my limbs.\n\nHigh Tinker Mekkatorque had trusted Mekgineer Thermaplugg, and Thermaplugg had betrayed him and every gnome with him and taken the city. King of nothing, the High Tinker called him. The job was to kill him.\n\nI went all the way down and did it. Mekkatorque likes to think the last thing through Thermaplugg's head was my foot, and I've seen no reason to correct that."] = "Ozzie's verdict on my first phial was that there wasn't enough in it and what there was had gone impure. The troggs weren't glowing hard enough. I was to get it straight from the tap, off the slimes and horrors deep in Gnomeregan, and that stuff falls apart if you look at it wrong. It took more than one try to bottle. Ozzie looked me over afterwards, impressed that I still had all my limbs.\n\nHigh Tinker Mekkatorque had trusted Mekgineer Thermaplugg, and Thermaplugg had betrayed him and every gnome with him and taken the city. King of nothing, the High Tinker called him. The job was to kill him.\n\nI went all the way down and did it. Mekkatorque likes to think the last thing through Thermaplugg's head was my foot, and I've seen no reason to correct that."
L["The gnomes are gone from Gnomeregan, but their machines kept running, and getting through the place took a while.\n\nThe mekgineer with Nogg's combination was Thermaplugg, at the very bottom, and he wasn't taking callers. I took the combination off him the hard way and opened the safe beside him. The rig blueprints were inside.\n\nNogg had known all along I could do it, and wanted me to know that Sovik had had doubts. Then Nogg cleared his throat and got to the point. Every gnomish innovation in that rig would be pulled apart and studied until it was a goblin innovation, and the next shredders would carry the lot."] = "The gnomes are gone from Gnomeregan, but their machines kept running, and getting through the place took a while.\n\nThe mekgineer with Nogg's combination was Thermaplugg, at the very bottom, and he wasn't taking callers. I took the combination off him the hard way and opened the safe beside him. The rig blueprints were inside.\n\nNogg had known all along I could do it, and wanted me to know that Sovik had had doubts. Then Nogg cleared his throat and got to the point. Every gnomish innovation in that rig would be pulled apart and studied until it was a goblin innovation, and the next shredders would carry the lot."
L["Ozzie's verdict on my first phial was that there wasn't enough in it and what there was had gone impure. The troggs weren't glowing hard enough. I was to get it straight from the tap, off the slimes and horrors deep in Gnomeregan, and that stuff falls apart if you look at it wrong. It took more than one try to bottle. Ozzie looked me over afterwards, impressed that I still had all my limbs.\n\nHigh Tinker Mekkatorque had trusted Mekgineer Thermaplugg, and Thermaplugg had betrayed him and every gnome with him and taken the city. King of nothing, the High Tinker called him. The job was to kill him.\n\nI went all the way down and did it, and brought his engineering notes back for the High Tinker. Mekkatorque likes to think the last thing through Thermaplugg's head was my foot, and I've seen no reason to correct that."] = "Ozzie's verdict on my first phial was that there wasn't enough in it and what there was had gone impure. The troggs weren't glowing hard enough. I was to get it straight from the tap, off the slimes and horrors deep in Gnomeregan, and that stuff falls apart if you look at it wrong. It took more than one try to bottle. Ozzie looked me over afterwards, impressed that I still had all my limbs.\n\nHigh Tinker Mekkatorque had trusted Mekgineer Thermaplugg, and Thermaplugg had betrayed him and every gnome with him and taken the city. King of nothing, the High Tinker called him. The job was to kill him.\n\nI went all the way down and did it, and brought his engineering notes back for the High Tinker. Mekkatorque likes to think the last thing through Thermaplugg's head was my foot, and I've seen no reason to correct that."
L["The gnomes are gone from Gnomeregan, but their machines kept running, and getting through the place took a while.\n\nThe mekgineer with Nogg's combination was Thermaplugg, at the very bottom, and he wasn't taking callers. I took the combination off him the hard way and opened the safe beside him. The rig blueprints were inside. Thermaplugg's engineering notes came out with me too, and those went to Nogg as well.\n\nNogg had known all along I could do it, and wanted me to know that Sovik had had doubts. Then Nogg cleared his throat and got to the point. Every gnomish innovation in that rig would be pulled apart and studied until it was a goblin innovation, and the next shredders would carry the lot."] = "The gnomes are gone from Gnomeregan, but their machines kept running, and getting through the place took a while.\n\nThe mekgineer with Nogg's combination was Thermaplugg, at the very bottom, and he wasn't taking callers. I took the combination off him the hard way and opened the safe beside him. The rig blueprints were inside. Thermaplugg's engineering notes came out with me too, and those went to Nogg as well.\n\nNogg had known all along I could do it, and wanted me to know that Sovik had had doubts. Then Nogg cleared his throat and got to the point. Every gnomish innovation in that rig would be pulled apart and studied until it was a goblin innovation, and the next shredders would carry the lot."
L["The Only Cure is More Green Glow"] = "The Only Cure is More Green Glow"
