L["The spirit totem wasn't enough, it turned out. Bath'rah wanted voodoo in it, and the strongest voodoo around was in the feathers of six trolls down in the Sunken Temple. They were still using them. I took them anyway.\n\nBath'rah worked the feathers into the totem and announced it was about time a troll got a full night's rest, then handed me something from a long life of collecting, for my trouble. The spirits of that place still don't care for Bath'rah. Now they have to get past the totem first."] = "The spirit totem wasn't enough, it turned out. Bath'rah wanted voodoo in it, and the strongest voodoo around was in the feathers of six trolls down in the Sunken Temple. They were still using them. I took them anyway.\n\nBath'rah worked the feathers into the totem and announced it was about time a troll got a full night's rest, then handed me something from a long life of collecting, for my trouble. The spirits of that place still don't care for Bath'rah. Now they have to get past the totem first."
